WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.380
Your site is fast.

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:06.050
So why does every small
change wait for a developer?

3
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.090
With Galley, click the text on the page,

4
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.136
or just ask for the change in plain words.

5
00:00:12.236 --> 00:00:13.636
Then proof it:

6
00:00:13.676 --> 00:00:16.556
every change marked up
like an editor's proof,

7
00:00:16.596 --> 00:00:18.350
beside your live site.

8
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.016
Publish, and it's a commit
in your own repository.

9
00:00:23.216 --> 00:00:24.936
Built for Astro.

10
00:00:24.976 --> 00:00:27.584
Open source. Free to use.
